[IQ Generator Preset]
# Lesson 16: on-off keying.
# OOK sends a one as a carrier burst and a zero as silence, normalised here to unit average energy. Because the mean of the symbols is not zero, the spectrum has a strong line at 0 Hz (the carrier) and the constellation shows one point at the origin. The eye is one-sided: a symbol is either at 0 or at about 1.4.
Version=2
Modulation=OOK
NumberOfSymbols=1024
SymbolRateBaud=1000
SamplesPerSymbol=8
Pulse=RRC
RRCBeta=0.2
SpanSymbols=10
AmplitudeGain=1
DataSource=Random
Seed=5489
Bits=
NoiseSampleCount=2048
NoiseSampleRateHz=8000
NoisePower=1
AwgnEnabled=true
AwgnSnrDb=20
NoiseSeed=5490
